sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Grove caller
  participant R as Independent Ravel
  participant P as Owner configuration
  participant H as Managed process
  G->>R: start-session: kind, intact mandate, public caller data
  opt Ravel 2.0.0 with configured directory injection
    R->>R: Acquire sources, then wrap the intact mandate after the preamble
    Note over R,P: originalPrompt keeps the mandate. Source failure stops before selection. No named-skill lookup
  end
  R->>P: Evaluate bounded selection without enclosing completion authority
  P-->>R: Selected command or refusal
  alt Refusal or selection failure
    R-->>G: Diagnostic and nonzero status, no managed process
  else Selected command
    R->>H: Start with launch prompt and fresh ending context
    H->>H: Find and read named skill through native install or injected paths
    H->>R: Prompt's exact end-session RESULT command
    R->>H: End managed group, reap and restore terminal
    alt Cleanup succeeds and result published
      R-->>G: Exact opaque stdout, successful status
    else Cancellation, cleanup failure or missing result
      R-->>G: No successful result
    end
  end
  Note over G,R: Grove knows no skill locations, Ravel preserves exact caller task and endings
